  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "\u0110\u1EA5u s\u0129"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Can\u2019t block], [Last
    Breath]\r\n- Khi ta ch\u1EBFt, H\u1ED3i sinh ta khi b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u v\xF2ng
    sau v\xE0 ban ta +1/ +1 v\u1EDBi m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n ta \u0111\xE3 ch\u1EBFt.\r\n-
    Ta kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 th\u1EE7."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 \xE2m binh \u2014 nh\u1EEFng vong l\xEDnh tr\u1EADn ho\u1EB7c
    c\xF4 h\u1ED3n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EA7n linh, th\u1EA7y ph\xE1p thu nh\u1EADn
    th\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9i qu\xE2n c\xF5i \xE2m. Ta \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c sai \u0111i
    canh gi\u1EEF, tr\u1EEB t\xE0; nh\u01B0ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nu\xF4i binh th\u1EA5t
    l\u1EC5 s\u1EBD b\u1ECB binh qu\u1EADt."
